A2DP: keep the I/O thread ID until it can be joined

Backport the thread ownership rule to the 1.4.0 transport code.
Keep the existing SCO and RFCOMM cleanup and PCM interface.
Reap a naturally exited A2DP worker before starting its replacement.

Upstream-Status: Backport [https://github.com/arkq/bluez-alsa/commit/18cf06cb9965ce672be6271ebb4dd85361c7b2b8]

--- a/src/ba-transport.c
